+### CS-02 — warranty length (high)
+
+Two incompatible warranty statements are live: "25–35 years on finish, up to 50 years structural" and "Manufacturer finish and structural warranties — 25 to 50 years".
+
+**Why it matters.** The second phrasing reads as a single span and implies a 50-year FINISH warranty, which no manufacturer offers. A warranty length is the one claim on this site that is directly contractual — it is restated in the quote and the contract.
+
+**Resolution.** Reconcile onto the first phrasing and attach the manufacturer warranty documents. Registered as warranty.finish (status: unsourced) in apps/web/content/claims.ts.
+
